error BYN2781: `xs` is used after it was moved

  15 │     consume(move xs)
     │             ^^^^^^^ a `defer failing` on line 14 uses it at scope exit
     │
  help: move `xs` before the `defer failing`, or move a `.copy(to: alloc)` of it instead

